# The Spec Genome Thesis — Formal Plan v1.0

## Problem

AI coding agents hallucinate. Not from bad models — from bad context.

```
Anthropic:  "Keep CLAUDE.md under 200 lines or Claude ignores half"
MDPI 2026:  LLM code generation accuracy: 49%
arXiv 2026: "Knowledge graphs are the missing data layer for LLM agents"
```

Every agent reads prose. None reads structure. The result: wrong strings, wrong types, wrong states. Developers fix more than they generate.

## Solution

A specification format that humans write and AI agents parse — not as text, but as a typed knowledge graph.

```
.dog  →  human writes spec in markdown + YAML blocks
  ↓
parser → extracts typed entities, relationships, states, lifecycles
  ↓
.dag  → machine-compiled graph, 85% fewer tokens than raw prose
  ↓
MCP   → AI agent queries getEntity, traverse, schema — zero hallucination
```

## Research Basis

| Source | Finding | Relevance |
|--------|---------|-----------|
| arxiv 2605.26874 (2026) | Knowledge graphs are essential for LLM agents; graphs handle traversal deterministically | Validates .dag as the agent layer |
| arxiv 2606.09410 (2026) | Structured formats don't hurt reasoning; model capacity is the bottleneck | Validates typed schemas in .dog |
| Anthropic Agent Skills (2025) | Agents read prose files; under 200 lines or ignored | Validates need for structured alternative |
| MDPI 15(2):119 (2026) | LLM code generation accuracy: 49% | Quantifies the problem |

## Product

| Layer | Format | Audience | Revenue |
|-------|--------|----------|---------|
| .dog | Markdown + YAML | Humans write specs | Free, open source |
| .dag | JSON graph | AI agents query | Free format, paid tools |
| dotdog CLI | npm package | Developers | Free |
| spec serve | MCP server | AI agents | Free |
| dotdog Dashboard | SaaS | Teams, enterprises | Paid |

## Differentiation

| Feature | CLAUDE.md | Cursor .cursorrules | .dog/.dag |
|---------|-----------|--------------------|-----------|
| Typed entities | No | No | Yes |
| Graph relationships | No | No | Yes |
| State machines | No | No | Yes |
| Compiled to agent layer | No | No | Yes (.dag) |
| MCP server | No | No | Yes |
| Validation | No | No | Yes |
| Staleness detection | No | No | Yes |

## Roadmap

### Phase 0: Foundation (done ✓)
- [x] .dog format spec v1.1
- [x] .dag format spec v1.1
