- [ ] MCP tool integration (Claude, Cursor, Copilot)

### Phase 3: Revenue
- [ ] dotdog.dev website
- [ ] Team dashboard (completeness scores, predictions)
- [ ] Enterprise tier (SSO, self-hosted, SLAs)
- [ ] specdog Certified partner program

